WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:04.320
SCP-682 Vs Extremely High Temperatures. Could the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:08.640
monstrous Hard to Destroy Reptile finally&nbsp;
be roasted to death in a super-heated room?

00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:13.440
The researchers at the SCP Foundation hoped&nbsp;
so. They locked it in a special chamber&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:18.000
and increased the temperature to truly immense&nbsp;
proportions, but rather than melting, as the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:23.600
researchers had hoped, it developed a carapace&nbsp;
of solid helium, which defended it from the heat.

00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:27.840
Even worse was that the carapace remained&nbsp;
in place, even as the room was reduced back&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:31.600
to safe temperatures. When personnel&nbsp;
were sent in to inspect the creature,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:37.120
the carapace abruptly shattered and exploded&nbsp;
all over the room, shredding everyone nearby.

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:43.200
682 had baited its victims inside, and gotten&nbsp;
a little payback for the extreme sauna session.

